<title>FRANCE: French budget deficit 329.4 bln Ffr at end Nov.</title>
<headline>French budget deficit 329.4 bln Ffr at end Nov.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's central government budget deficit reached 329.4 billion francs at the end of November 1996, the finance ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The total compared to 340.0 billion francs at the end of November 1995.</p>
<p>The finance ministry said in a statement that the government was confident about meeting a target fixed in the 1996 Finance Act limiting the budget deficit to 288 billion francs.  </p>
<p>&quot;The budget deficit in December will improve by significantly more than last year owing to forecasts of expected receipts during the month and because of a smaller rise in spending at the end of the year compared with that of 1995,&quot; the ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The government remains very confident that it will reach its objective of keeping the budget deficit at the level forecast in the initial budget,&quot; the statement said.  </p>
<p>The ministry gave the following breakdown of budget receipts: (figures in billions of francs, year on year changes in percent, 1996 year forecast):</p>
<p> REVENUES			end Nov 96  Nov 95  pct	1996</p>
<p> Net tax receipts	     1,220.7  1,154.4   5.7    1,378.3</p>
<p>  of which: -- income tax     296.3    279.2   6.1	312.3</p>
<p>  -- net company tax	    108.3     93.1  16.3	144.0</p>
<p>  -- petrol duties		133.5    128.3   4.1	149.0</p>
<p>  -- net Value Added Tax	551.8    511.9   7.8	612.5</p>
<p>  -- miscellaneous		130.8    141.9  -7.8	160.5</p>
<p> Non-tax receipts		 115.0    108.3   6.2	154.0</p>
<p> Local authority, EU charges -221.5   -214.8   3.1     -243.7</p>
<p> General budget receipts    1,176.0  1,104.5   6.5    1,288.6</p>
<p> SPENDING			end Nov 96  Nov 95  pct</p>
<p> Ordinary civil spending    1,212.5  1,151.2   5.3</p>
<p>  of which: debt		  224.9    220.9   1.8</p>
<p> Capital civil spending	  87.2     82.7   5.4</p>
<p> Ordinary military spending    96.8     93.4   3.6</p>
<p> Capital military spending     67.8     69.7  -2.7</p>
<p> TOTAL BUDGET SPENDING	1,464.3  1,397.0   4.8</p>
<p>BALANCE</p>
<p> Total net spending	   1,464.3  1,397.0   4.8</p>
<p> Total net receipts	   1,176.0  1,104.5   6.5</p>
<p> General budget deficit	-288.3   -292.5</p>
<p> Special Treasury Accounts    -41.1    -47.5</p>
<p> TOTAL CENTRAL GOVT DEFICIT  -329.4   -340.0</p>
